1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:01,880
(Leonard:)Did you get the part?

2
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:05,383
(Penny:)No, they said I was too perky.

3
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:11,552
Wanna talk about not getting
love from a parent?

4
00:00:11,719 --> 00:00:15,519
(Leonard:)You know what I used to do when I was
little to have sensation of human contact?

5
00:00:15,681 --> 00:00:18,021
(Penny:)Yeah, you grabbed your penis
and wouldn't let go.

6
00:00:23,272 --> 00:00:24,312
(Penny:)Your mother told me.

7
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:25,612
[LEONARD SCOFFS]

8
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:28,195
(Leonard:)Of course she did.
That's not what I was gonna say.

9
00:00:28,361 --> 00:00:32,111
Uh... Uh, when I was 10-years old,
I built a hugging machine.

10
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:34,907
- A hugging machine?
- Yeah.

11
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:38,916
I got a mannequin, stuffed it
with an electric blanket so it'd be warm...

12
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:43,830
...and I built two radio-controlled arms
that would hug me and pat my back.

13
00:00:44,544 --> 00:00:46,424
(Penny:)Oh, that is so sad.

14
00:00:46,963 --> 00:00:48,753
(Leonard:)- Know what the saddest part was?
- What?

15
00:00:48,923 --> 00:00:51,093
(Leonard:)My father used to borrow it.

16
00:00:54,595 --> 00:00:57,435
(Beverley:)Your scan data
will be very helpful to my research.

17
00:00:57,598 --> 00:00:59,348
(Beverley:)You have a remarkable brain.

